    "detailed_description": "The game consists of finishing several levels, solving by clicking with the mouse or using the keyboard to complete the tasks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClassic - by clicking on a square, the others around it change inversely (cross). Do this until all the squares are 0. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPusher - with the help of the keyboard, press the key indicated on the screen, until the matrix is \u200b\u200bcompletely finished.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCounter - Click on the square until it reaches 0, every time you click, it decreases by 1, but be careful, if the number is negative, you lose the game.",
